#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/ov5640.rst:102
msgid ""
"The OV5640 has a voice-coil-actuator autofocus lens. Trigger a single "
"autofocus pass via `csi.CSI.ioctl` with `csi.IOCTL_TRIGGER_AUTO_FOCUS` — the"
" sensor sweeps the focus motor once and locks on whatever's in front of it::"
msgstr ""
"OV5640 memiliki lensa autofocus dengan aktuator kumparan suara. Picu satu "
"kali putaran autofocus melalui `csi.CSI.ioctl` dengan "
"`csi.IOCTL_TRIGGER_AUTO_FOCUS` — sensor menyapu motor fokus sekali dan "
"mengunci pada objek yang ada di depannya::"

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/ov5640.rst:109
msgid ""
"Re-issue the ioctl any time the scene changes — the autofocus is one-shot, "
"not continuous."
msgstr ""
"Kirim ulang ioctl setiap kali pemandangan berubah — autofocus bersifat satu "
"kali tembak, bukan kontinu."
